sequenceDiagram
  participant C as Client
  participant X as pds-xrpc
  participant L as pds-lexicon
  participant S as actor store.sqlite
  participant R as pds-repo
  participant O as ops.sqlite
  participant Q as sequencer.sqlite
  participant F as subscribers
  C->>X: POST /xrpc/com.atproto.repo.createRecord
  X->>X: session, then the body in the lexicon's order
  X->>L: validate the record (mode true, false or unset)
  L-->>X: valid, unknown, or the Reference's message
  X->>S: begin immediate (one writer for a repository)
  S->>R: format the commit: the writes, the next rev, the actor's key
  R->>S: read the tree nodes on the path
  R-->>S: signed commit, new blocks, unused blocks, event blocks
  S->>S: root, blocks, record index, backlinks, blob references
  X->>O: note the account and the rev
  X->>S: commit
  X->>Q: append #commit (ops, blocks, since, rev, prevData)
  X->>O: remove the note
  X->>F: wakeup, no frame on the bus
  F->>Q: read pages in seq order
  X-->>C: 200 uri, cid, commit, validationStatus
  Note over O,Q: A stop after the commit leaves the note. At the next start the server appends #sync with the head.
